d:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 87px, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 88px 92px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 55px, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 56px 60px),\n      linear-gradient(135deg, #f3b000, #ffd36b);\n    border: 14px solid #e2e3df;\n  }\n\n  .energy-illustration::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 350px;\n    top: 212px;\n    width: 330px;\n    height: 340px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 47%, #a7aaab 48% 51%, transparent 52%),\n      linear-gradient(62deg, transparent 0 43%, #aaa 44% 46%, transparent 47%),\n      linear-gradient(118deg, transparent 0 43%, #aaa 44% 46%, transparent 47%);\n  }\n\n  .right-kitchen {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 1778px;\n    right: -25px;\n    width: 875px;\n    height: 425px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(32deg, #f7f7f4 0 47%, #d8dadd 47% 62%, #fff 62%);\n  }\n\n  .right-kitchen::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 52px;\n    right: 84px;\n    width: 235px;\n    height: 158px;\n    border: 9px solid #d0d3d4;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd978, #f1a900);\n  }\n\n  .right-kitchen::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 122px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    width: 425px;\n    height: 215px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 43% 21%, transparent 0 25px, #222 27px 31px, transparent 33px),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 63% 21%, transparent 0 25px, #222 27px 31px, transparent 33px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, #eceeef 0 23%, #1c1c1c 23% 48%, #eceeef 48% 100%);\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 43px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    z-index: 40;\n  }\n\n  .left-page .page-number {\n    left: 190px;\n  }\n\n  .right-page .page-number {\n    right: 126px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"spread\">\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"report-name\">2024·美的集团ESG报告</div>\n    <nav class=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"报告章节\">\n      <span>关于本报告</span>\n      <span>走进美的</span>\n      <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span class=\"active\">共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span>附录</span>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"left-page\" aria-label=\"第111页\">\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">自我成长 治理全面升级</h1>\n\n    <p class=\"intro\">\n      美的集团深知遵循法律法规是企业稳健发展的前提，而恪守商业道德和职业操守则是推动企业持续成长的核心。<br>\n      我们不断强化合规管理与文化体系，打造一个正直、透明的职场环境；我们不断优化反腐败和举报体系，致力<br>\n      于塑造一个阳光、正向的企业形象，以期成为行业典范，推动行业道德标准持续提升。\n    </p>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">企业管治完善者</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"governance-text\">\n      董事会高效运作是战略决策与监督核心，投资者关系是价值沟通与资源整合基础，风险防控是全流程安全保障，<br>\n      三者协同共同构建可持续发展的治理闭环。\n    </p>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder home-illustration\" aria-label=\"智能家居场景插图\">\n      <figcaption>[Illustration: smart-home scene]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder recycling-illustration\" aria-label=\"社区环保回收场景插图\">\n      <figcaption>[Illustration: community recycling scene]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder science-illustration\" aria-label=\"科研与产业建筑场景插图\">\n      <figcaption>[Illustration: science and industry scene]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder energy-illustration\" aria-label=\"清洁能源、太阳能板与风力发电场景插图\">\n      <figcaption>[Illustration: renewable-energy scene]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">111</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"right-page\" aria-label=\"第112页\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title board-title\">董事会有效性</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"board-text\">\n      我们坚信提升董事会运行有效性对美的集团的公司治理和业务运营至关重要。因此我们关注董事投入公司事务<br>\n      的时间和精力、董事技能培训、董事会构成及董事会绩效评估等事项。我们认为，董事会出席率能在一定程度<br>\n      上体现董事对公司事务的投入和关注，故在《美的集团股份有限公司章程》中将董事连续两次未能亲自出席、<br>\n      也不委托其他董事出席董事会会议的行为，视为董事不能履行职责；同时要求董事会召开时，应有过半数的董<br>\n      事出席。\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"attendance\" aria-label=\"报告期内每名董事于董事会会议出席率均为100%\">\n      <div class=\"attendance-label\">报告期内</div>\n      <div class=\"attendance-body\">\n        <span class=\"attendance-copy\">每名董事于董事会会议出席率均为</span>\n        <span class=\"attendance-rate\">100%</span>\n        <div class=\"meeting-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"board\"></span>\n          <span class=\"person\"></span>\n          <span class=\"table-left\"></span>\n          <span class=\"table-right\"></span>\n          <span class=\"leg-left\"></span>\n          <span class=\"leg-right\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section-title investor-title\">投资者关系</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"investor-copy\">\n      <p>\n        美的集团严格遵守其股票上市地信息披露相关法律法规，以及本公司发布的《美的集团股份有限公司章程》<br>\n        《美的集团股份有限公司信息披露管理办法》等制度，履行披露信息真实、准确、完整、及时、公平的承诺，<br>\n        明确和规范信息披露的职责、审议与披露信息流程等工作。美的集团信息披露工作已连续多年获得深圳证券交<br>\n        易所A级评价。\n      </p>\n      <p>\n        我们高度重视与投资者的互动和关系的维护。通过美的集团官方网站投资者关系专栏、线上交流会、“互动易”<br>\n        平台等多种方式与投资者进行沟通，广泛倾听并积极回应他们的关注。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder right-kitchen\" aria-label=\"智能家居厨房与客厅场景插图\">\n      <figcaption>[Illustration: smart kitchen and living-room scene]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">112</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
